#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"PlatformIO supports the most popular testing frameworks and allows you to "
"easily switch between them using the :ref:`projectconf_test_framework` "
"option in :ref:`projectconf`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"You can mix different frameworks in the same project. For example, use a "
"more advanced C++ testing framework with Mocks for the :ref:"
"`platform_native` development platform to run desktop tests on a host "
"machine and a lightweight framework, such as :ref:"
"`unit_testing_frameworks_unity`, for running tests on the target embedded "
"device with constrained resources."
msgstr ""

